{"id":"8fb39f8406bbe27f","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-dynamic-acyclic-reach.md","title":"无环图可达关系的一阶动态维护","display":"thm-dynamic-acyclic-reach — 无环图可达关系的一阶动态维护","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-dynamic-acyclic-reach","aliases":["29-thm-dynamic-acyclic-reach"],"display":"thm-dynamic-acyclic-reach — 无环图可达关系的一阶动态维护","depends_on":["[[29-df-dyn-fo]]","[[29-df-tc]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem14.20 and proof, pp.230–231, scans245–246","source_basis":"扫描246原图及文本层；显式反身TC、无环历史承诺及删除空操作保护，给出本地不变量证明","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(2).zip修订；既有原书定位、日期和过往核对叙述作为继承记录，未重新取得或查看原书原件","revision_verification":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-dynamic-acyclic-reach"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-dynamic-acyclic-reach</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dynamic-acyclic-reach — 无环图可达关系的一阶动态维护"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f49962f64360a930\" href=\"?note=f49962f64360a930\" title=\"29-df-dyn-fo\">29-df-dyn-fo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e0bc79e14d83be0f\" href=\"?note=e0bc79e14d83be0f\" title=\"29-df-tc\">29-df-tc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem14.20 and proof, pp.230–231, scans245–246"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"扫描246原图及文本层；显式反身TC、无环历史承诺及删除空操作保护，给出本地不变量证明"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(2).zip修订；既有原书定位、日期和过往核对叙述作为继承记录，未重新取得或查看原书原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle E^{(2)}\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle E^{(2)}\\rangle\\)</span>；辅助词汇 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho=\\langle P^{(2)}\\rangle\">\\(\\rho=\\langle P^{(2)}\\rangle\\)</span>。输入和同步更新见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f49962f64360a930\" href=\"?note=f49962f64360a930\" title=\"29-df-dyn-fo\">29-df-dyn-fo</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TC}_{U_n}\">\\(\\operatorname{TC}_{U_n}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e0bc79e14d83be0f\" href=\"?note=e0bc79e14d83be0f\" title=\"29-df-tc\">29-df-tc</a> 的反身传递闭包。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Acyc}\">\\(\\operatorname{Acyc}\\)</span> 和合法历史族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^{\\rm dag}\">\\(H^{\\rm dag}\\)</span> 在下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,a,b,u,v\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x,y,a,b,u,v\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\{x,y,a,b,u,v\\}|=6\">\\(|\\{x,y,a,b,u,v\\}|=6\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\">\\(x,y\\)</span> 是辅助二元关系的个体论元变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\">\\(a,b\\)</span> 是请求参数变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v\">\\(u,v\\)</span> 是更新公式内的量词变量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau\\cup\\{\\leq\\}\\cup\\rho}\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau\\cup\\{\\leq\\}\\cup\\rho}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(\\theta)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}(\\theta)=\\varnothing\\)</span>；下式初始化与更新公式连同 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 构成程序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_{\\rm dag,\\theta}\">\\(\\Pi_{\\rm dag,\\theta}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_\\theta\">\\(Q_\\theta\\)</span> 在下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[P:=X]\">\\(A[P:=X]\\)</span> 是保留输入解释的扩张。公式更新只在旧状态上求值。</li>\n<li>辅助关系符号是新符号：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sym}(\\rho)\\cap(\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau)\\cup\\{\\leq\\})=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{Sym}(\\rho)\\cap(\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau)\\cup\\{\\leq\\})=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Acyc}(A)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg\\exists l\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\exists(v_0,\\ldots,v_l)\\in|A|^{l+1}\\;(v_0=v_l\\land\\forall i&lt;l\\;(v_i,v_{i+1})\\in E^A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Acyc}(A)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg\\exists l\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\exists(v_0,\\ldots,v_l)\\in|A|^{l+1}\\;(v_0=v_l\\land\\forall i&lt;l\\;(v_i,v_{i+1})\\in E^A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H_n^{\\rm dag}\\coloneqq\\{h\\in\\mathsf{Req}_{\\tau,n}^{&lt;\\omega}\\mid\\forall t\\leq|h|\\;\\operatorname{Acyc}(A_t^{n,h})\\},\\qquad H^{\\rm dag}\\coloneqq(H_n^{\\rm dag})_{n\\geq1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H_n^{\\rm dag}\\coloneqq\\{h\\in\\mathsf{Req}_{\\tau,n}^{&lt;\\omega}\\mid\\forall t\\leq|h|\\;\\operatorname{Acyc}(A_t^{n,h})\\},\\qquad H^{\\rm dag}\\coloneqq(H_n^{\\rm dag})_{n\\geq1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\eta_P(x,y)\\coloneqq(x=y),\\qquad\\delta_{\\mathsf{ins},E,P}(x,y;a,b)\\coloneqq P(x,y)\\lor(P(x,a)\\land P(b,y)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\eta_P(x,y)\\coloneqq(x=y),\\qquad\\delta_{\\mathsf{ins},E,P}(x,y;a,b)\\coloneqq P(x,y)\\lor(P(x,a)\\land P(b,y)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\delta_{\\mathsf{del},E,P}(x,y;a,b)\\coloneqq P(x,y)\\land\\left(\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\neg E(a,b)\\lor\\neg(P(x,a)\\land P(b,y))\\\\&amp;\\lor\\exists u\\exists v\\;(P(x,u)\\land E(u,v)\\land P(v,y)\\land P(u,a)\\land\\neg P(v,a)\\land(u\\ne a\\lor v\\ne b))\\end{aligned}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\delta_{\\mathsf{del},E,P}(x,y;a,b)\\coloneqq P(x,y)\\land\\left(\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\neg E(a,b)\\lor\\neg(P(x,a)\\land P(b,y))\\\\&amp;\\lor\\exists u\\exists v\\;(P(x,u)\\land E(u,v)\\land P(v,y)\\land P(u,a)\\land\\neg P(v,a)\\land(u\\ne a\\lor v\\ne b))\\end{aligned}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\delta_{o,1,1}\\coloneqq\\delta_{o,E,P}\\quad(o\\in\\{\\mathsf{ins},\\mathsf{del}\\}),\\qquad\\Pi_{\\rm dag,\\theta}\\coloneqq(\\langle P^{(2)}\\rangle,\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle\\rangle,\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle\\rangle,\\langle\\eta_P\\rangle,(\\delta_{o,1,1})_o,\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\delta_{o,1,1}\\coloneqq\\delta_{o,E,P}\\quad(o\\in\\{\\mathsf{ins},\\mathsf{del}\\}),\\qquad\\Pi_{\\rm dag,\\theta}\\coloneqq(\\langle P^{(2)}\\rangle,\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle\\rangle,\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle\\rangle,\\langle\\eta_P\\rangle,(\\delta_{o,1,1})_o,\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall h\\in H_n^{\\rm dag}\\;\\forall t\\leq|h|\\;P^{B_t^{\\Pi_{\\rm dag,\\theta},n,h}}=\\operatorname{TC}_{U_n}(E^{A_t^{n,h}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall h\\in H_n^{\\rm dag}\\;\\forall t\\leq|h|\\;P^{B_t^{\\Pi_{\\rm dag,\\theta},n,h}}=\\operatorname{TC}_{U_n}(E^{A_t^{n,h}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q_\\theta\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathcal A_\\tau\\mid A[P:=\\operatorname{TC}_{|A|}(E^A)]\\models\\theta\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{MaintFO}_\\tau(\\Pi_{\\rm dag,\\theta},Q_\\theta,H^{\\rm dag}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q_\\theta\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathcal A_\\tau\\mid A[P:=\\operatorname{TC}_{|A|}(E^A)]\\models\\theta\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{MaintFO}_\\tau(\\Pi_{\\rm dag,\\theta},Q_\\theta,H^{\\rm dag}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q_\\theta\\in\\operatorname{DynFO}_\\tau[H^{\\rm dag}].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q_\\theta\\in\\operatorname{DynFO}_\\tau[H^{\\rm dag}].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>初态为空图，反身闭包是恒等关系。插入一条边后的新路径，要么原已存在，要么可分解为旧路径 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\leadsto a\">\\(x\\leadsto a\\)</span>、新边 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,b)\">\\((a,b)\\)</span>、旧路径 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\leadsto y\">\\(b\\leadsto y\\)</span>。无环历史排除了依赖新边反复绕行的情况。</p>\n<p>删除不存在的边必须是空操作；故在原书印刷231页公式外显式加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg E(a,b)\">\\(\\neg E(a,b)\\)</span> 保护。若删去已有边，原路径未经过该边则保留。设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\leadsto a\">\\(x\\leadsto a\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\leadsto y\">\\(b\\leadsto y\\)</span>，而存在绕开被删边的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 路径；取其最后一个能到达 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 的顶点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span>，下一点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 不能到达 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>，且边 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(u,v)\">\\((u,v)\\)</span> 不是被删边，给出存在见证。这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 不能到达 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\to b\\leadsto y\\leadsto a\">\\(a\\to b\\leadsto y\\leadsto a\\)</span> 构成环。</p>\n<p>反过来，见证中的旧 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\leadsto u\">\\(x\\leadsto u\\)</span> 路径不可能使用被删边：否则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\leadsto u\\leadsto a\">\\(b\\leadsto u\\leadsto a\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\to b\">\\(a\\to b\\)</span> 构成环；旧 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\leadsto y\">\\(v\\leadsto y\\)</span> 路径也不能使用该边，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\leadsto a\">\\(v\\leadsto a\\)</span>。中间边已显式排除被删边，因此三段拼接确实保留。未受影响分支同理。归纳得到完整可达关系不变量，任意固定 FO 读出均随之正确。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^{\\rm dag}\">\\(H^{\\rm dag}\\)</span> 是全历史承诺，不能删去该参数后宣称对任意图成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-dyn-fo","status":"resolved","id":"f49962f64360a930","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-dyn-fo]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-tc","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc79e14d83be0f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-tc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-dyn-fo","status":"resolved","id":"f49962f64360a930","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau=\\langle E^{(2)}\\rangle$；辅助词汇 $\\rho=\\langle P^{(2)}\\rangle$。输入和同步更新见 [[29-df-dyn-fo]]；$\\operatorname{TC}_{U_n}$ 采用 [[29-df-tc]] 的反身传递闭包。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-tc","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc79e14d83be0f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau=\\langle E^{(2)}\\rangle$；辅助词汇 $\\rho=\\langle P^{(2)}\\rangle$。输入和同步更新见 [[29-df-dyn-fo]]；$\\operatorname{TC}_{U_n}$ 采用 [[29-df-tc]] 的反身传递闭包。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau=\\langle E^{(2)}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho=\\langle P^{(2)}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TC}_{U_n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Acyc}","display":false},{"tex":"H^{\\rm dag}","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,a,b,u,v\\in\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"|\\{x,y,a,b,u,v\\}|=6","display":false},{"tex":"x,y","display":false},{"tex":"a,b","display":false},{"tex":"u,v","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau\\cup\\{\\leq\\}\\cup\\rho}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}(\\theta)=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_{\\rm dag,\\theta}","display":false},{"tex":"Q_\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"A[P:=X]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sym}(\\rho)\\cap(\\operatorname{Sym}(\\tau)\\cup\\{\\leq\\})=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Acyc}(A)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg\\exists l\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\exists(v_0,\\ldots,v_l)\\in|A|^{l+1}\\;(v_0=v_l\\land\\forall i<l\\;(v_i,v_{i+1})\\in E^A).","display":true},{"tex":"H_n^{\\rm dag}\\coloneqq\\{h\\in\\mathsf{Req}_{\\tau,n}^{<\\omega}\\mid\\forall t\\leq|h|\\;\\operatorname{Acyc}(A_t^{n,h})\\},\\qquad H^{\\rm dag}\\coloneqq(H_n^{\\rm dag})_{n\\geq1}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\eta_P(x,y)\\coloneqq(x=y),\\qquad\\delta_{\\mathsf{ins},E,P}(x,y;a,b)\\coloneqq P(x,y)\\lor(P(x,a)\\land P(b,y)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\delta_{\\mathsf{del},E,P}(x,y;a,b)\\coloneqq P(x,y)\\land\\left(\\begin{aligned}&\\neg E(a,b)\\lor\\neg(P(x,a)\\land P(b,y))\\\\&\\lor\\exists u\\exists v\\;(P(x,u)\\land E(u,v)\\land P(v,y)\\land P(u,a)\\land\\neg P(v,a)\\land(u\\ne a\\lor v\\ne b))\\end{aligned}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\delta_{o,1,1}\\coloneqq\\delta_{o,E,P}\\quad(o\\in\\{\\mathsf{ins},\\mathsf{del}\\}),\\qquad\\Pi_{\\rm dag,\\theta}\\coloneqq(\\langle P^{(2)}\\rangle,\\langle\\langle x,y\\rangle\\rangle,\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle\\rangle,\\langle\\eta_P\\rangle,(\\delta_{o,1,1})_o,\\theta).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall h\\in H_n^{\\rm dag}\\;\\forall t\\leq|h|\\;P^{B_t^{\\Pi_{\\rm dag,\\theta},n,h}}=\\operatorname{TC}_{U_n}(E^{A_t^{n,h}}).","display":true},{"tex":"Q_\\theta\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathcal A_\\tau\\mid A[P:=\\operatorname{TC}_{|A|}(E^A)]\\models\\theta\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{MaintFO}_\\tau(\\Pi_{\\rm dag,\\theta},Q_\\theta,H^{\\rm dag}).","display":true},{"tex":"Q_\\theta\\in\\operatorname{DynFO}_\\tau[H^{\\rm dag}].","display":true},{"tex":"x\\leadsto a","display":false},{"tex":"(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"b\\leadsto y","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg E(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\leadsto a","display":false},{"tex":"b\\leadsto y","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"(u,v)","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"a\\to b\\leadsto y\\leadsto a","display":false},{"tex":"x\\leadsto u","display":false},{"tex":"b\\leadsto u\\leadsto a","display":false},{"tex":"a\\to b","display":false},{"tex":"v\\leadsto y","display":false},{"tex":"v\\leadsto a","display":false},{"tex":"H^{\\rm dag}","display":false}],"bytes":4298,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-146","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[29-prop-dynamic-parity]]、[[29-thm-dynamic-acyclic-reach]] — 奇偶性与无环图可达关系的动态维护"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-183","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-dynamic-acyclic-reach]]"}],"outgoing":["f49962f64360a930","e0bc79e14d83be0f"]}